<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">Estheri</book>
  <para style="h">Estheri</para>
  <para style="toc1">Estheri</para>
  <para style="toc2">Estheri</para>
  <para style="mt">Estheri</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera India aṭanga Sudan thlenga ram bial za leh sawmhnih leh pasarih chunga rorêltu hun laiin hêng thil hi a lo thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hetih lai hian lal chu Susa khawpuiah a awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a lal kum thum kum chuan a ram milian te, a ṭhuihruai te, Persia leh Media sipai hotu te, bial tina Ramawptu te leh bial tina milian te tân ruai a ṭheh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thla ruk chhûng ngawt a ram ropui tak hausakzia te, a lalzia leh a neihnunzia te a entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng hnu chuan a chênna khawpui Susa khuaa lo kal, milian leh mitê te tân lal in hual chhûngah ni sarih ruai a ṭheh leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutah chuan la zai sîn puan vâr chi te, a dumpâwl chi te, a senduk chite an zâr a, a zârna hruihrual chu sailungvâr bana tangkaraw khângah chuan an thlung a. Rangkachak leh tangkaruaa siam ṭhutthlêng dûp an hûng thluah a; a tualzâwlah chuan sailungvâr te, lungmawi chi hrang hrang - a sen te, a hring te, a dumpâwl te an phah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An zu semna no chu rangkachak no a ni a, inang pakhat mah a awm lo; lal chuan uain chu a ren lo hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In tâwk chin tuk a awm lo; tu pawh, an duh zât zât intîr tûrin lal chuan a chhiahhlawhte chu a hrilh diam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalnu Vasti pawhin lal Ahasuera in pakhatah a hrangin nuho tân ruai a ṭheh ve bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni sarih ni chuan lal chu a rui lungpuam ta deuh va, mi tilreh pasarih - Mehumana te, Biztha te, Harbona te, Bigtha te, Abagtha te, Zethara te, Karkasa te leh ama chhiahhlawh bîkte chu a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalnu Vasti chu a lallukhum khum chunga rawn hruai tûrin a tîr a. Lalnu chu nu hmêlṭha tak a ni a, lal chuan a chhuang êm êm a, a miliante leh a ruai chhimtute chu a hmêl ṭhatzia entîr a duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal thupêk an han hrilh chuan lalnu Vasti chu a kal duh ta lo va. Lal chu a thinur êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalte hian dân leh a kenkawh dân tûr chungchângah dânhremite an râwn ziah ṭhîn a. Lal Ahasuera pawh chuan dânhremite chu a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûngte chu Karsena te, Sethara te, Admatha te, Tarsisa te, Meresa te, Marsena te, Memukana te, Persia leh Media rama milian, lal bula awm ṭhîn te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Lal Ahasueran a chhiahhlawhte lalnu Vasti a kohtîr a, a thu a lo awih duh lo va. Hetiang chungchânga kan ram dân eng nge ni, engtia tih tûr nge ni ang?” tiin anni chu a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Memukana chuan lal leh milian dang hmaah, “Lalnu Vasti hian lal hi a thamlo mai ni lovin a rama miliante leh ram pum chhûnga paho hi a lo thamlo hle tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalnu thil tih dân hi nuhovin an hriat hunah an pasalte chu an pawisa lo vang a, ‘Lal Ahasueran lalnu Vasti a koh pawhin a kal duh bîk hlei nêm,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni tlâk hmain Persia leh Media ram milian nupuite pawhin lalnu thiltih dân an hriatin an pasalte thu an awih duh bîk lo vang a, paho chu an thin a rim ṭeuh mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalin rem a tihzâwng a nih chuan lalnu Vasti hian, ‘lal hmêl a hmu leh tawh lo tûr a ni,’ tiin thupêk chhuah rawh. Sût leh mai mai chi loh Persia leh Media dân bu-ah ziak ni rawh se. Lalnu atân mi dang tha zâwk i nei leh mai dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu thupêk chu i ram zau taka puan a nih hnu chuan nuho chuan an pasalte chu an rethei emaw, an hausa emaw an pawisa ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal leh miliante chuan chu chu ṭha an tih zâwng tak a ni a. Memukana rawt angin lal chuan a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ram bial tinah, a bial ṭawng leh hawrawp ṭheuh hmangin thu a thawn darh ta a; “Chhûng tinah pa a lal ber ang a, a thu chu awih vek tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A thinur a daih hnu pawhin lal chuan Vasti thil tih dân leh a chungchânga thupêk chu a ngaihtuah neuh neuh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal thurâwntute chuan a hnênah, “Lal tân nula hnahkhat, hmêlṭha tak zawn ni teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bial tinah hotu ruat la, chûng chuan an bial nula hmêlṭha zawng chhuak sela, i khawpui Susa khuaah lal inah rawn hruai khâwm teh se, lal ina hmeichhe pindan enkawltu mi tilreh Hegaia hnênah rawn hruai sela, inchei zirtîr rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I nula duh ber i thlang ang a, Vasti aiah lalnu-ah i dah dâwn nia,” an ti a. Lal chuan ṭha a ti a, chutiang chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Susa khuaah chuan Juda pakhat, Zaira fapa Mordekaia a awm a, Benjamin hnam Kisa fa Simeia thlah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezaran Jerusalem aṭanga Judai ram lal Jekonia leh a mi mante sala a hruai ṭum khân Mordekaia pawh hi a tel ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A pamite nupa chu an thih tawh avângin an fanu Estheri, Hebrai ṭawnga Hadasi an tih chu, a enkawl seilian a, ama fanu ang chiahin a en a ni, nula hmêlṭha tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal thupêk an puan chhuah hnu chuan Susa khawpuiah Hegaia lo enkawl tûrin nula an rawn hruai zut zut a. Estheri pawh chu lal inah hmeichhe pindan vêngtu Hegaia hnênah chuan an rawn hruai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmêlṭha a lo ti êm êm a, a lo duhsak ta hle a. A incheina tûrte chu a pe zung zung a, ei tûr tuihnai hnai a pe a, a chhiahhlawhah, amah cheitu atân lal ina nula pasarih a ruatsak bawk a. Lal ina hmeichhe awmna pindan nuam berah a chhiahhlawhte nên chuan a awmtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Estheri chuan eng hnam nge a niha, tute nge a chhûngte tih a sawi lo; Mordekaia khân sawi a khap tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Estheri chuan eng nge a tiha, engtin nge a awm zêl tih hre tûrin ni tin lal ina hmeichheho awmna pindan kawtah chuan Mordekaia chu a kal ziah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal nupui tûr an chei chhûng hian kum khat a awh ṭhîn. Thla ruk chhûng chu Mura hriak an chulh a; chumi zawhah thla ruk chhûng bawk rimtui chi dang an chulh leh ṭhîn a ni. Chutia an chei hnu chauh chuan lal hnênah an kal ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal hnêna an kal dâwn chuan chhiahhlawh nula, an duh ber pakhat, an hruai thei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zân lamah lal hnênah chuan an hruai a, zîngah chuan lal nupuiho awmnaah mi tilreh Saazgasa kutah an dah ṭhîn a; lalin a lo duh hlea, a hming lam meuhva a koh loh chuan an kal leh tawh ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Estheri chu lal hnêna a kal hun a lo thleng ta a, Estheri hi Mordekaia pami fanu a ni a, fanu anga a neih tâk a ni a. Estheri chuan lal hnêna a kal dâwn chuan hmeichhe pindan enkawltu Hegaian tâwk a tih ang chiahin a inchei a, a hmu apiangin hmêlṭha an ti êm êm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera lal kum sarihna, thla sâwmna, Tebet thla chuan Estheri chu lal hnênah chuan an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal chuan nula dang zawng zawng ai chuan Estheri chu a lo duh a, a lo duhsakin a ngaina bîk ta hle a; lallukhum a khumtîr a, Vasti aiah lalnu-ah a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Estheri lawm nân lal chuan ruai ropui tak a ṭheh a, milian leh lal ṭhuihruai zawng zawng an awm a, chumi ni chu a ram puma chawlhni-ah a puang a. A hausa bawk a, pêk âwm tak tak thilpêk a sem ur ur bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal chuan Mordekaia chu hna lian tak a thawhtîr tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Estheri pawh chuan Juda mi a nih tu mah a hrilh lo, Mordekaian tu mah hrilh loh tûr a tih kha, a naupan têt aṭanga a thu a zâwm ṭhîn ang khân a zâwm zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mordekaia chu lal ina hna lian tak lalin a thawhtîr avâng chuan lal in kawngka vêngtu mi tilreh pahnih Bigthana leh Teresa chu lal Ahasuera chungah chuan an thinur a, lal chu thah tumin an phiar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu thil chu Mordekaia chuan a lo hre ru a, Estheri chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thil awm dân an han chhui chiang a, a lo dik ngei a, an pahnih chuan an khai hlum ta a. Chu thu chu lal thiltih chhinchhiahna bu-ah an ziak lût a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Agag mi Hamedata fapa Hamana chu lal Ahasuera chuan a kaisântîr a, hotu dang zawng zawng chungah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal thupêk angin lal ina thawk zawng zawng chuan Hamana chu a lo kalin ṭhingṭhiin chibai an bûk ṭhîn tûr a ni. Mordekaia erawh chuan a ti ve duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal ina thawktute chuan Mordekaia hnênah, “Lal thupêk engtizia nge i zawm duh loh le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal thu chu zâwm ve mai tûrin an hrilh ṭhîn a; mahse, Mordekaia chuan, “Juda ka ni a, Hamana hmaah ka kûn thei lo,” a ti a. Tichuan, Mordekaia awm dân chu a ngaithei dâwn nge dâwn lo hriat nân Hamana chu an hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mordekaia chu a hmaah a kûn duh lo va, chibai pawh a bûk duh lo tih a han hriat chuan a thinur hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Mordekaia chu Juda mi a ni tih a han hriat chuan Mordekaia mai sawisa lovin Persia rama Juda awm zawng zawng chu tihmang vek a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahasuera lal kum sâwm leh pahnihna, thla hmasa ber, Nisan thla chuan a thiltum tihhlawhtlin nân eng ni leh eng thla nge ṭha ber ang tih hriat nân ai a entîr a; chu aien ni chu ‘Purim’ an ti ta a ni. Thla sâwm leh pahnih, ni sâwm leh pathum ni chu ni remchâng berah an ngai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hamana chuan lal hnênah, “I ram pum hmun hrang hranga awm zîngah hian hnam pakhat inzep an awm a, bial tinah an awm darh a ni. Hnam dang dân ang ni lo, anmahni dân bîk an nei a, ram dân pawh an zâwm ve duh lo. Hetianga i awmtîr zêl chuan i tân a ṭha lo hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalin rem a tih chuan tihhlumtîr vek mai teh. Chutianga i tih chuan ram awp nân lal sumah tangkarua kg. nuaithum leh sîngli ka rawn chhûng thei ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thupuan nemnghehna zungbun chu lal chuan a phawi a, Juda-ho hmêlmapa Agag mi Hamedata fapa Hamana chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mipuite leh an tangka chu i kutah ka pe a che, i duh duhin ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thla hmasa ber ni sâwm leh pathum ni chuan lal lehkhaziaktute chu Hamana chuan a ko va, lal thupuan chu a ziaktîr a, ram chhûnga ṭawng chi hrang hrang leh an hawrawp hmangin a ziaktîr nghâl a. Lal aiawhtu te, ramawptu te leh rorêltu te hnênah lal zungbuna nem chu thawn chhuah tûrin a buatsaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram puma bial tinah, lal thupêk chu an tlânpui a. Chûng thupêk chu ni thuhmun, thla sâwm leh pahnih, Adar thla, ni sâwm leh pali niin hman tûr a ni - Juda zawng zawng, ṭhalai leh tar te, naupang leh hmeichhiate lam pawh thah vek tûr thu a ni; an thil neihte pawh râllâk sum anga neihsak vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bial tinah chu thupêk chu an chhiar chhuak tûr a ni, a hun takah, thupêk angin mi an chêt theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Susa khawpuiah pawh thupêk chu lal chuan a puantîr a; bial hrang hrangah erawh chuan lehkha chu an tlânpui a. Lal leh Hamana te chuan zu an in veng veng lai chuan Susa khuaa mite chu an mangangin an chiai hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />An thil tih tâk zawng zawng chu Mordekaian a lo hriat chuan a puan a pawtthlêr a, saiip puan a sin a, a lu-ah vaivut a phul a, lungngai takin a ṭap tlawk tlawk a; chuti chung chuan khua chu a fang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal in tual luhna kawngka chu a va thleng a; saiip sin tu mah an luhtîr phal loh avângin lal in hung chhûngah chuan a lût lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram bial tina lal thupêk an puanna apiangah, Juda-ho chu an ṭap chuah chuah mai; chaw an nghei a, mi tam tak chu saiip puan sinin vaivutah an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mordekaia awm dân chu chhiahhlawh nulate leh mitilrehte chuan Estheri chu an rawn hrilh a, lalnu chu a mangang hle a, Mordekaia chu saiip puan hlîpa a sin tûrin puan a pêktîr a; a lo duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah enkawltu tûra lalin mi tilreh pakhat a ruatsak Hathaka chu a ko va, chinchâng zâwt chiang tûrin Mordekaia hnênah chuan a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hathaka chu lal in luhna kawngka tualzâwlah chuan a va chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mordekaia chuan thil awm dân zawng zawng a lo hrilh a, Juda-ho tihchimih an nih phawt chuan lal sum bâwma Hamanan tangka chhûn luh a tum zâtte pawh chu a lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda-te râwt tûr thupêk Susa khawpuia an puan kawpi pawh Hathaka chu a pe a. Mordekaia chuan lehkha chu Estheri pe tûrin a ngên a, thil awm dân zawng zawng chu a hrilhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hathaka chuan thu chu a va thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Estheri chuan hetiang thu hi Mordekaia hrilh tûrin a tîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ram chhûng mi tu pawhin, mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh, koh lohva lal in chhûngrila lûta, lal va hmu chu, a ṭhuihruaite ngei pawh, tihhlum tûr tih mi zawng zawngin an hria, lalin a rangkachak laltiang a lo lekchhuahsakte chauh chuan chu dân chu an pumpelh thei a ni. Ni sawmthum zet chu min la ko leh ta lo a ni,” tiin Mordekaia chu a hrilhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Estheri thu chu Mordekaia an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mordekaia chuan hetianga hrilh tûrin Estheri hnênah chuan a tîr leh a, “Lal in chhûnga i awm avângin nangmah chauh hi him bîk tûrah inngai suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tûn hun anga i ngawih mai mai chuan hmun danga Juda awmte chu engtin tin emaw chhan chhuah an nih hlauh pawhin; nang leh i pa chhûngte chu kan thi vek dâwn a ni. Hetiang hun atân ngei hian lalnu-ah i lo ṭang a ni dâwn lâwm ni?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Estheri chuan Mordekaia hnênah a tîr leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kal la, Susa khuaa Juda awm zawng zawng ko khâwm la, ka tân a chhûn a zânin chaw ngheiin ni thum chhûng ṭawngṭai teh u. Ka chhiahhlawh nulaho nên keini pawhin chutiangin kan ṭawngṭai ang. Chumi hnuah chuan dân ni lo mah se lal hnênah chuan thih leh thih ka kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mordekaia chu a hâwng a, Estheri tih ang chuan a ti ta vek a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni thum chaw a nghei ni chuan Estheri chuan lal thuam a inbel a, lal pindan hual chhûng tual, lalṭhutthlêng awmna kawtah chuan a kal a. Kawngka hawi zâwngin lalṭhutthlêngah chuan lal chu a lo ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalin pâwna lalnu Estheri ding chu a hmu a, a lo khawngaih a, a rangkachak laltiang chu a lekchhuahsak a, Estheri chuan a va pan a, a tiang hmâwr chu a va khawih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Lalnu Esther, eng nge ni i duh min hrilh teh, ka ram chanve pawh ni se ka pe ang che,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Estheri chuan a chhâng a, “Lalin rem i tih chuan zâninah Hamana nên ka ruai siamsak che rawn ei teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal chuan Hamana chu lalnu ruai kîl tûra lo kal vat tûrin a chah a, Lal leh Hamana chu lalnu ruai kîl tûr chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uain an in laiin lal chuan, “Eng nge i duh, ka ram chanve hial pawh ni se ka pe ang che,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Estheri chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Lalin min khawngaiha, ka thil dîl tûr chu i phal dâwn chuan naktûk zânah ruai ka lo buatsaih leh ang a, Hamana nên rawn ei leh ula ka lo hrilh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hamana ruai ṭheh zo chu rilru hlim tak leh lâwm takin a haw a; mahse, Mordekaia chu lal in hual chhûng kawngka bulah a hmu a, zah derna lantîr tûrin din pawh a lo ding duh lo va; chu chu a han hmuh chuan Hamana chu a thinur ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A insûm hrâm hrâm a, a haw ta a. A ṭhiante leh a nupui Zeresi a kohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hausakzia te, fapa a ngahzia te, lalin a kaisântîr thu te, lalin milian dang zawng zawng aia a ngaihsânzia te sawiin a ina lêng tûra a sâwm a ṭhiante chu a uankhum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Lalnu meuh pawhin lal leh kei chauh a ruai chhim tûrin min sâwm a ni, naktûk zân atân pawh min sâwm dêr tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, lal in luhna kawngkaa Mordekaia ṭhu ka hmuh chhûng chu hêng zawng zawng hi engah mah ka ngai lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nupui leh a ṭhiante chuan, “Tawng sawmngaa sâng, khaihlumna tûr ban phuntîr la, naktûk zîngah lal hnênah Mordekaia chu khai hlum dîl la, hlim takin ruai chu i kîl thei mai ang chu,” an ti a. Hamana chuan ṭha a ti hle a, inkhai hlumna tûr chu a siamtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi zân vêk chuan lal chu a muhîl thei lo va, thil hlui chhinchhiahnate chu a lâk chhuahtîr a, an chhiar chu a ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal ina mi tilreh Bigthana leh Teresa te pahnihin lal thah tuma an phiar thute kha an chhiar kher a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Hemi avâng hian Mordekaia hi chawimawiin lâwmman kan pe em?” a ti a. A chhiahhlawhte chuan, “Eng mah kan tihsak lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Tu nge lal in tuala awm saw?” a ti a. Hamana chuan Mordekaia khaihlumna tûr ban a siamtîr a, khai hlum dîl tûrin lal in hual chhûngah a lo kal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal chhiahhlawhte chuan, “Biak tum chein Hamana a lo kal a ni,” an ti a. “Lo lût rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hamana a lo luh chuan, “Mi pakhat chawimawi ka duh a, engtin nge ka tih ang?” lal chuan a lo ti a. ‘Lal chuan kei lo chu tu dang nge chawimawi a duh ang le,’ a ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal hnênah chuan, “Lalin chawimawi a duha tân chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />lal hâk ṭhin kawr han la chhuak sela, a chuanna ṭhin sakawr rawn kai sela, a chawimawina lukhum khumtîr ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I miliante zînga ropui ber ko la, ani chuan lal kawrte chu hâktîr sela, sakawrah chuantîr bawk sela, khua fanpui rawh se. An kal pah chuan, ‘Lalin chawimawi a duha chu hetiang hian a chawimawi a ni,’ ti zêl rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal chuan Hamana hnênah, “Hmanhmawh la, lal kawrte leh sakawrte chu la la, Juda mi Mordekaia hi i sawi ang chuan chawimawi rawh. I sawi ang zawng zawng khân ti ang che, lal tual luhna kawngka bulah a awm saw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hamana chuan lal kawrte chu a la a, Mordekaia chu a hâktîr a; Mordekaia chu sakawrah chuan a chuang a; khawpui kawtthlêrah chuan Hamanan sakawr chu a kaihsak a, an kal pah chuan mipui hnênah, “Lalin chawimawi a duha chu hetiang hian a chawimawi a ni,” tiin a au luah luah zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mordekaia chu lal tual luhna bulah chuan a kal leh a; Hamana erawh chu zaka hmai khuhin inah a hâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nupui leh a ṭhiante chu a chunga thil thleng zawng zawng chu a hrilh vek a. A nupui leh a ṭhian fing tak takte chuan, “Mordekaia hi i chelh lo ṭan ta a nih hi. Juda a ni a, i ngam lo vang; i tlâwm zâwk ngei ang maw le,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûng thu an sawi lai chuan Hamana chu lal ina Estheri ruai chhim tûra hruai nghâl tûrin mi tilrehte an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal leh Hamana chu Estheri ruai buatsaih ei tûr chuan an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uain an in lai vêkin lal chuan, “Lalnu Esther, eng nge i duh min hrilh tawh teh le, ka ram chanve hial pawh ni se, min hrilh la, ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalnu chuan a chhâng a, “Aw Lalpa , lalin min khawngaiha ṭha i tih zâwng a nih chuan ka nunna zuah tûrin ka dîl a che; ka mite nunna pawh zuah tûrin ka ngên a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tihhluma tihboral vek tûrin kei leh ka mite chu tih kan ni tawh. A hmei a pain bawihah min hralh ni lek sela chu ka ngawi thei ang a, ka tibuai lo vang che; tûnah zawng, kan hmêlmate hian min that chimit vek dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera chuan Estheri hnênah, “Chutianga lo ti ngam ta mai chu tu nge a nih a, khawia awm nge a nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Estheri chuan, “Kan hmêlma leh min ertu chu he misualpa Hamana hi a ni alâwm,” a ti a. Hamana chu lalnu hmaah chuan a khûr chhe ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uain an in lai chuan lal thinur chu a tho va, lal huanah chuan a kal chhuak a, Hamana erawh chu lalnu hnêna a nunna zuah ngên tûrin in chhûngah chuan a awm a, lal hmêl a hmuhin a tân a hlauhawm tih a hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chu huan aṭang chuan uain an inna pindanah chuan a lo lût leh a, Estheri ṭhutnaa Hamana lo bawk chu a hmu a, “Ka inah, ka mit hmuh ngeiah pawh lalnu hi sual a tum vei a ni maw?” a ti a. Lal a han ṭawng chhuah chuan Hamana hmai chu an khuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal bula awm ṭhînte zînga mi tilreh pakhat Harbona chuan, “Lal tâna thil ṭha titu Mordekaia khai hlum nân tawng sawmngaa sâng Hamana hian a in bulah ban a phun asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Chutah chuan va khai hlum rawh u,” a ti a. Mordekaia khai hlumna tûra a siamah chuan Hamana chu an khai hlum a, lal thinur chu a dai ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Juda-te hmêlma Hamana in leh lo chu lal Ahasuera chuan lalnu Estheri chu a pe a. Estheri chuan lal hnênah Mordekaia nêna an inchhûngkhat dânte a hrilh a. Chuta chin chu lal hnênah duh duhin Mordekaia chu a kal thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal zungbun Hamana bun kha lal chuan a la a, Mordekaia chu a buntîr a. Estheri chuan Hamana in leh lo chu Mordekaia kutah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Estheri chuan lal hnênah sawi tûr a la nei cheu va. A ke bulah a bawkkhup a, Hamana thil tihpawi, Juda-te tihmang a tum chu, sût tûrin mittui nên a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chuan Estheri chu a tiang a lekchhuahsak a; tichuan, Estheri chu a tho va, lal hmaah chuan a ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Lalin ṭha a tiha, min khawngaih takzet chuan, lal ram bial tinah Juda awmte that tûra Agag mi Hamadata fapa Hamanan lehkha a thawn kha sût lehna ziak ni teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite chunga hetiang thil ṭha lo thleng tûr hi ka ngai ngam lo, ka laichîn ngeite an that tûr hi hmuh pawh ka ngam lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal chuan lalnu Estheri leh Juda mi Mordekaia hnênah, “Hamana chu Juda-te chunga kut thlâk a tum avângin ka khai hlum a, a in leh lo pawh lalnu Estheri ka pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal thu-a ziak, zungbuna nem hnan tawh chu sût leh mi a ni hlei nêm. In duh ang angin Juda mite hnênah ka hmingin ziak ula, zungbunin nem rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thla thumna Sivan thla ni sawmhnih leh pathum ni chuan lal lehkha ziaktute chu a ko va, Juda-te chungchânga a duh ang chu a ziaktîr a. India ram aṭanga Sudan ram thleng, lalram bial za leh sawmhnih leh pasariha lal aiawhtu te, ramawptu te leh bial hotu te chu anmahni ṭawng leh an hawrawpa ziakin a thawn nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera hmingin lehkha chu an ziak a, a zungbun chuan an nem a. Sakawr tlân chak chi, lalin thu thawn darh nâna a vulh chunga chuangte kutah an pe a, an tlânpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu lal lehkhaah chuan: Juda-te chu an awmna khua apiangah lo inpun khâwma anmahni leh an nupui fanaute rawn beih tumtute an lo beih lêt ve lal chuan a phalsak a. An awmna bial tina anmahni rawn beitute chu an bei lêtin an that thei ang a, an thahte in leh lo pawh râllâk sum angin an nei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thla sâwm leh pahnihna Adar thla, ni sâwm leh pathum ni chuan lal Ahasuera ram chhûnga bial zawng zawngah, Juda-ho thah tûr tih ni-ah, he thupêk thar hi Juda-te chuan an hmang thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />He thu hi dân ngheta hman tûr leh Juda-te pawh an hmêlmate chungah phuba la tûra an inrâlrin theih nân bial tina mite hnênah puan tûr a ni,” tiin an ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal thupêkin sakawr chungchuang mite chu lal sakawr chakah an chuang a, an tlân ta zut zut a. Chu thupêk chu Susa khawpuiah pawh an puang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mordekaia chuan puan zai sîn senduk kawrfual a ha a, lal puan bah dumpâwl leh vâr chu a bât a, chawimawina rangkachak lukhum a khum a; lal in ata chu a lo chhuak a, Susa khawpui kawtthlêrah mi tin lâwmin an lo au dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Juda-te chu an hlim hle a, an ngaih a ṭhain an thla a muang bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal thupêk an chhiarna bial leh khua apiangah Juda-te chu an lâwm a, hlim takin ruaite an ṭheh a. Juda-te chu an hlauh ve thung tâk avângin mi tam tak chu Juda-ah an inleh phah ta nghe nghe a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal thupêk hman ni tûr Adar thla ni sâwm leh pathum ni chu a lo thleng a. Chumi ni chuan an hmêlmate chuan Juda-te chu tihchimih an tum a nih kha; mahse, Juda-te chan chu a ṭha ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera ram chhûngkaw tina Juda-te vêngah chuan Juda-te chu an pung khâwm a, anmahni rawn beih tumtu bei lêt tûrin an lo inrâlring a. Tu hnam pawhin Juda-ho chu an hlau va, an khawih ngam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bial hotu - lal aiawh te, ramawptu te leh sawrkâr hnathawk dang te chuan Mordekaia an hlauh avângin Juda-te chu an pui ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal inah Mordekaia chuan ngaih ropui a hlawh ta hle mai tih ram pumah a lo thang ta a, thil a tithei ta deuh deuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, Juda-te chuan an hmêlmate chu duh duhin an sawisa thei a, khandaih nên an bei a, an hmêlma zawng zawng an that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Susa khawpuiah pawh Juda-te chuan mi zanga lai an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêng Parsandata te, Dalfona te, Aspata te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Porata te, Adalia te, Aridata te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Parmasta te, Arisaia te, Aridaia te, Vaizata te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda hmêlma Hamedata fapa Hamana fa sâwmte pawh hi Juda-te chuan an that a; amaherawhchu, tu mah an rawk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan lal khawpui Susa khuaa mi an thah zât chu lal an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal chuan lalnu Estheri hnênah, “Lal khawpui Susa-ah pawh Juda-te chuan mi zanga, Hamana fa sâwmte nên an that a, ram chhûng bial dangah eng ang takin che ang maw! Duh dang i la nei em? Min hrilh teh, ka tihsak zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Estheri chuan, “Lalin rem a tih chuan vawiina an tih angin Susa khuaa Juda-te chuan naktûkah pawh ti leh sela, Hamana fa sâwmte chu thinga khai ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutianga ti tûr chuan lal chuan thu a pe a, Susa khuaah chuan an puang a. Hamana fa sâwmte pawh chu thingah an khai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Susa khuaa Juda awmte chu Adar thla ni sâwm leh pali ni chuan an pung khâwm leh a, Susa khuaah mi zathum an that leh a; mahse, tu mah an rawk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ram chhûng bial tina Juda-te pawh chu mahni invênghim tûrin an pung khâwm a. Anmahni hawtu, an hmêlma, mi sîngsarih leh sângnga an that a; amaherawhchu, tu mah an rawk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Adar thla ni sâwm leh pathum ni chuan an ti a. A tûk ni sâwm leh pali ni chuan tu mah an that tawh lo, hlim taka ruai ṭheh ni-ah an hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Susa khuaa Juda-te erawh chuan ni sâwm leh panga ni chuan awmni an kham a, ni sâwm leh pathum leh ni sâwm leh pali ni-ah an hmêlmate an that a, ni sâwm leh panga ni chuan an tâwp chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan thingtlâng khaw lama Juda-te chuan Adar thla, ni sâwm leh pali ni hian awmni an kham a, hlim takin ruaite an ṭheh a, thilpêkte an inpe tawn ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mordekaia chuan hêng thute hi lehkhabu-ah a ziaktîr vek a, Persia ram chhûnga Juda awm zawng zawng, a kilkhâwr bera awmte chenin lehkha a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adar thla ni sâwm leh pali ni leh ni sâwm leh panga ni, kum tin awmni khama, kût tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng ni-ahte hian a ni Juda-ten an hmêlmate laka an intihfihlîma, lungngaihna leh manganna thla chu hlimna leh lâwmna thlaa an chantîr ni. Ruaite ṭheha, hlim taka hmangin ei tûr thilte inpe tawn tûrin a hrilh a; mi retheite pawh ei tûr pe ve tûrin a hrilh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda-te chuan Mordekaia thupêk chu an zâwm a, kum tin kûtah an neih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Agag mi Hamadata fapa Hamana, Juda-te hmêlma khân Juda-te râwt nân eng ni nge ṭha ber ang tih hriat nân ai a entîr a. Juda-te chu tihchimih a tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, Estheri chu lal hnênah a kal a, lal chuan thupêk a chhuah ta a. Chu thupêk avâng chuan Juda-te tuar tûra a buatsaih chu Hamana chuan a fate nên an tuar ta a, thingah an khai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An chunga thil thlengte avâng leh Mordekaia lehkha avâng chuan chu kût chu Purim ‘Aien’ Kût an vuah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Juda-te chuan an thlah zêlte tân pawh, a hun takah, Mordekaia sawi angin hêng ni hnihahte hian kum tin awmni an kham ziah tûr a ni tih dân an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Juda chhûngkua tu pawhin, ṭhang lo thar zêlte chuan bial tinah leh khaw tinah Purim kût ni te hi kumkhuain an hmang ṭhîn tûr a ni tih thu an titlu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalnu Estheri, Abdaia fanu chuan, Purim kût chungchânga Mordekaia lehkha chu a nemnghet a ni tih thu chu Mordekaia lehkhaah chuan an thawn chhuak tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lehkha chu Juda zawng zawng hnêna thawn a ni; Persia ram bial za leh sawmhnih leh pasarih hnênah a kawpi an pe bawk a; Juda-te chu thlamuang tak leh râlmuang taka awm tûrin an chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Juda-te chu, a hun takah, an thlah zêlte nên, chaw nghei leh lusûn tih dân an neih ṭhin angin Purim ni te chu hmang ṭhîn tûrin an chah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chu chu Mordekaia leh lalnu Estheri thu a ni; Lalnu Estherin Purim kût chungchâng a nemnghehna thu chu lehkhabu-ah ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Ahasuera chuan a ram kilkhâwr bera awmte leh tuipui kama awmte chu chhiah a chawitîr vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thiltih ropui leh mak tak tak te, sawrkâr milian bera Mordekaia a siam thu te chu Persia leh Media lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mordekaia chu lalber Ahasuera dawttu a ni. A Juda-puite pawhin an ngaina a, an ngaisâng êm êm a ni. A mite ṭhatna tûrin hna a thawk a, an thlahte pawh him taka an awm theih nân kawng a zawng zêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
</usx>
